==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Tirtouga|44}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion; both cards have the Shell Attack attack.
*'''Shell Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Squirtle|68}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

